# Local Supabase CLI runtime state — never source, never commit.
.branches
.temp

# Real secret values for any Edge Function (e.g. supabase/functions/revenuecat-webhook/.env used
# with `supabase functions serve --env-file`) — never source, never commit. Patterns with no
# leading slash apply at every depth under this directory, so this also covers
# supabase/functions/revenuecat-webhook/.env and any sibling function's .env. `.env.*` additionally
# covers .env.local/.env.production/etc. `.env.example` is explicitly un-ignored below — it must
# only ever contain placeholder values (see supabase/README.md), never real secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
